{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc 'tail -75 neither.log; tail -24 census-dry.log; tail -22 census-mutant.log'","aggregated_output":"totals: {'items': 2077, 'extracted': 1884, 'skipped': 0, 'merged': 193, 'not_processed': 0, 'returned': 0, 'failed': 0, 'evidence': 5120, 'new_views': 43, 'judged': 1616, 'changed': 882, 'closed': 1} seconds: 375\nlast completed seq 1884 old-2 1884\nviews: rebuilt 43 stored 43 equal\nview_keys: rebuilt 43 stored 43 equal\nevidence: rebuilt 5102 stored 5102 equal\nevidence_links: rebuilt 6306 stored 6306 equal\njudgements: rebuilt 1616 stored 1616 equal\nrungs: rebuilt 137 stored 137 equal\nview_switches: rebuilt 44 stored 44 equal\nsuccessions: rebuilt 2 stored 2 equal\ndependencies: rebuilt 0 stored 0 equal\n{\n \"equal to old-2\": true,\n \"link jobs asked (answered neither)\": 14,\n \"questions in them\": 105,\n \"old-2's refused answers met again\": [\n  \"cfd45dde68ce\",\n  \"907eb29065b7\",\n  \"6d0c31a8460d\",\n  \"137e5f747345\"\n ],\n \"left unmet\": []\n}\n8 eligible ['v1'] not eligible 2\n22 eligible [] not eligible 1\n42 eligible [] not eligible 2\n45 eligible [] not eligible 1\n49 eligible ['v1', 'v2'] not eligible 7\n62 eligible ['v8', 'v1', 'v2'] not eligible 8\n100 eligible [] not eligible 1\n101 eligible [] not eligible 1\n122 eligible [] not eligible 1\n145 eligible [] not eligible 1\n148 eligible ['v9', 'v8', 'v1', 'v2'] not eligible 13\n206 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14'] not eligible 14\n265 eligible ['v14', 'v8', 'v9', 'v1', 'v15', 'v2'] not eligible 15\n321 eligible ['v14', 'v16', 'v9', 'v1', 'v8', 'v2', 'v15'] not eligible 16\n398 eligible [] not eligible 1\n456 eligible [] not eligible 1\n483 eligible [] not eligible 1\n534 eligible ['v17', 'v14', 'v16', 'v9', 'v1', 'v8', 'v15', 'v2'] not eligible 20\n546 eligible [] not eligible 1\n586 eligible [] not eligible 1\n590 eligible [] not eligible 1\n618 eligible [] not eligible 1\n646 eligible [] not eligible 1\n649 eligible [] not eligible 1\n746 eligible ['v14', 'v9', 'v15', 'v2', 'v1', 'v21', 'v16', 'v8', 'v17'] not eligible 27\n821 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v15', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14', 'v16', 'v17', 'v21', 'v28'] not eligible 28\n883 eligible [] not eligible 1\n893 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1029 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v15', 'v29', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14', 'v16', 'v17', 'v21', 'v28'] not eligible 31\n1102 eligible ['v28', 'v17', 'v14', 'v9', 'v2', 'v32', 'v1', 'v8', 'v15', 'v16', 'v21', 'v29'] not eligible 32\n1106 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1238 eligible ['v17', 'v14', 'v21', 'v16', 'v9', 'v33', 'v8', 'v1', 'v15', 'v2', 'v28', 'v29', 'v32'] not eligible 34\n1262 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v15', 'v29', 'v32', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14', 'v16', 'v17', 'v21', 'v28', 'v33', 'v35'] not eligible 35\n1296 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1394 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1543 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1664 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1677 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1828 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1874 eligible [] not eligible 1\nexit 0\n546 eligible [] not eligible 1\n586 eligible [] not eligible 1\n590 eligible [] not eligible 1\n618 eligible [] not eligible 1\n646 eligible [] not eligible 1\n649 eligible [] not eligible 1\n746 eligible ['v14', 'v9', 'v15', 'v2', 'v1', 'v21', 'v16', 'v8', 'v17'] not eligible 36\n821 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v15', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14', 'v16', 'v17', 'v21', 'v28'] not eligible 38\n883 eligible [] not eligible 1\n893 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1029 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v15', 'v29', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14', 'v16', 'v17', 'v21', 'v28'] not eligible 42\n1102 eligible ['v28', 'v17', 'v14', 'v9', 'v2', 'v32', 'v1', 'v8', 'v15', 'v16', 'v21', 'v29'] not eligible 44\n1106 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1238 eligible ['v17', 'v14', 'v21', 'v16', 'v9', 'v33', 'v8', 'v1', 'v15', 'v2', 'v28', 'v29', 'v32'] not eligible 47\n1262 eligible ['v1', 'v2', 'v15', 'v29', 'v32', 'v8', 'v9', 'v14', 'v16', 'v17', 'v21', 'v28', 'v33', 'v35'] not eligible 49\n1296 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1394 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1543 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1664 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1677 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1828 eligible [] not eligible 1\n1874 eligible [] not eligible 1\nlinks proposed by the fake answers: 105\nexit 0\nmutant (fake answers 'reads' for every pair, links written): caught: RuntimeError judging failed; day 2026-07-01 remains resumable: judging: Stop('a request other than a link question missed the archive')\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
