{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n -A 13 '\"'^## D(431|667)'\"\\\\b' ../../DECISIONS-log.md; nl -ba ../../../src/hivemind/idea.py | sed -n '115,129p'; nl -ba ../../../src/hivemind/model.py | sed -n '241,261p'; nl -ba neither.log | sed -n '1,28p'; nl -ba census-mutant.log\"","aggregated_output":"4795:## D431 · 2026-11-12 · The clean path is compared end to end with production as it now runs, with no preset questions on either side\n4796-\n4797-- **Asked:** \"整条新线路要和谁比，才算“比线上好”（你定的上线门槛 D427）？新系统不开公司财务指标题；线上版本自 11 月 5 日起也不再预设题目。\"\n4798-  - Options: current production (recommended): \"双方都不预设题目，条件相同；用冻结的标准、同一天、各跑三轮。“可评分的 7 道题”的结果单独列出。\"; the seeded version with 22 preset questions (\"新系统每轮天然少约 11 道公司财务指标题，几乎不可能赢\"); the seven graded questions only.\n4799-  - Alex: \"和现在的线上版本比 (Recommended)\".\n4800-- **Decided:** D427's end-to-end comparison is the clean path against production as it now runs (no preset questions, D370),\n4801-  on the frozen ruler, the same day, three draws each; the seven graded questions (D395) are reported beside. The seeded\n4802-  comparison (D392) remains a diagnostic, not the gate. Raised by the council's read of where the path stands\n4803-  (`clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/kr-consensus.md`).\n4804-- **Scope:** the clean path's end-to-end acceptance (D427).\n4805-\n4806-## D432 · 2026-11-12 · After Stage B, the next phase is how Step 1 cuts a matter into theses\n4807-\n4808-- **Asked:** \"第二段测完之后，先做哪件大事？两位评审都认为最大的差距在第 1 步“把一件事切成题”的方式。\"\n--\n9460:## D667 · 2026-11-17 · Under D666 and D439 (council, run-plan rounds 1–10): the release comparison's run plan and the rules it takes for this run\n9461-\n9462-- **Council:** `docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/`: `RUN-PLAN-v1.md` … `RUN-PLAN-v9.md`, `review-codex-1..10.md` (thread\n9463-  01a1ebfe-4f67-7c72-af87-7830055e0f09, memories off), a fresh Claude reviewer each round (READY at v7), and `ROUND-LOG.md` (what each round\n9464-  taught).\n9465-- **Decided**, for this comparison only; D665's rule is unchanged:\n9466-  1. **The plan** is `RUN-PLAN.md` v9, frozen as `RUN-PLAN-v9.md`. Build-level checks run at the stage-0 freeze review\n9467-     (`freeze-review-notes.md`), which gates the first paid send.\n9468-  2. **Exposure.**\n9469-     - Plan §1.2 governs the whole census: the closed set of read kinds, the search roots and every exclusion. Any read excludes an article.\n9470-     - **Not reads,** and only these:\n9471-       - the search index built over the whole corpus;\n9472-       - this comparison's own files (its census, reader packets and outputs are not prior exposure);\n9473-       - **An old-system replay folder and its byte copies.** Only when its decision record or run note shows it ran the then-production\n   115\t    missing = sorted(o for o in (aliases or {}) if o not in counts)\n   116\t    return (f'Objects with open views as of {as_of} (object, kind, number of views): {covered}.'\n   117\t            + (f' Objects in the universe with no view yet: {\", \".join(missing)}.' if missing else ''))\n   118\t\n   119\t\n   120\tdef judged(ledger, view_id, as_of, detailed=False):\n   121\t    state = service.state_as_of(ledger, view_id, as_of)\n   122\t    if not state:\n   123\t        return None\n   124\t    rung = next((g for g in store.rungs_of(ledger, view_id) if g['position'] == state['position']), {})\n   125\t    result = {'position': state['position'], 'label': rung.get('label', '')}\n   126\t    if detailed:\n   127\t        result.update(condition=rung.get('condition', ''), day=state['judgement_day'], reasons=state['reasons'])\n   128\t    return result\n   129\t\n   241\t        return [] if value is None else [f'{path}: expected null']\n   242\t    return []\n   243\t\n   244\t\n   245\tdef request_identity(request):\n   246\t    \"\"\"The exact serialized request and its archive key, shared by callers and validation.\"\"\"\n   247\t    encoded = json.dumps(request, sort_keys=True, ensure_ascii=False)\n   248\t    return encoded, hashlib.sha256(encoded.encode('utf-8')).hexdigest()\n   249\t\n   250\t\n   251\tdef call(archive, cfg, setting, system, user, schema, schema_name, purpose, *, transport=None):\n   252\t    provider = cfg.provider\n   253\t    request = build_request(setting, system, user, schema, schema_name, provider)\n   254\t    request_json, sha = request_identity(request)\n   255\t    hit = archive.lookup(sha)\n   256\t    prompt_chars = len(system) + len(user)\n   257\t    if hit:\n   258\t        call_id, answer_json, _, input_tokens, output_tokens = hit\n   259\t        return Answer(json.loads(answer_json), call_id, sha, True, prompt_chars, input_tokens or 0, output_tokens or 0, 0.0)\n   260\t    started = time.time()\n   261\t    response = (transport or openai_transport)(provider, request)\n     1\ttotals: {'items': 2077, 'extracted': 1884, 'skipped': 0, 'merged': 193, 'not_processed': 0, 'returned': 0, 'failed': 0, 'evidence': 5120, 'new_views': 43, 'judged': 1616, 'changed': 882, 'closed': 1} seconds: 375\n     2\tlast completed seq 1884 old-2 1884\n     3\tviews: rebuilt 43 stored 43 equal\n     4\tview_keys: rebuilt 43 stored 43 equal\n     5\tevidence: rebuilt 5102 stored 5102 equal\n     6\tevidence_links: rebuilt 6306 stored 6306 equal\n     7\tjudgements: rebuilt 1616 stored 1616 equal\n     8\trungs: rebuilt 137 stored 137 equal\n     9\tview_switches: rebuilt 44 stored 44 equal\n    10\tsuccessions: rebuilt 2 stored 2 equal\n    11\tdependencies: rebuilt 0 stored 0 equal\n    12\t{\n    13\t \"equal to old-2\": true,\n    14\t \"link jobs asked (answered neither)\": 14,\n    15\t \"questions in them\": 105,\n    16\t \"old-2's refused answers met again\": [\n    17\t  \"cfd45dde68ce\",\n    18\t  \"907eb29065b7\",\n    19\t  \"6d0c31a8460d\",\n    20\t  \"137e5f747345\"\n    21\t ],\n    22\t \"left unmet\": []\n    23\t}\n    24\t8 eligible ['v1'] not eligible 2\n    25\t22 eligible [] not eligible 1\n    26\t42 eligible [] not eligible 2\n    27\t45 eligible [] not eligible 1\n    28\t49 eligible ['v1', 'v2'] not eligible 7\n     1\tmutant (fake answers 'reads' for every pair, links written): caught: RuntimeError judging failed; day 2026-07-01 remains resumable: judging: Stop('a request other than a link question missed the archive')\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=../../../src python3 -c 'import contextlib, math\nimport window_test as w\nb=w.july_test.budget_module()\nclass MemoryLedger(b.SharedLedger):\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.state={\\\"ceiling\\\":float(\\\"nan\\\"),\\\"spent\\\":0.2,\\\"reserved\\\":0.0,\\\"attempts\\\":0,\\\"overrun\\\":False,\\\"refused\\\":0,\\\"stopped\\\":False}\n    @contextlib.contextmanager\n    def _locked(self):\n        yield self.state\nl=MemoryLedger()\nprint(\\\"census rejects NaN:\\\",l.state[\\\"ceiling\\\"] > w.CENSUS_CEILING)\nprint(\\\"ledger grants after \"'$0.20 with NaN:\",l.reserve(0.008064))\nprint(\"three simultaneous:\",3*.008064,\"84 worst-case bundles:\",84*.008064)'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
